{
  "_readme": [
    "Which kind of doctor a predicted condition points towards.",
    "",
    "WHY THIS IS A MAPPING AND NOT A MODEL:",
    "the relationship between the 41 conditions this project predicts and a",
    "medical specialty is one-to-one and already known. A classifier trained on",
    "41 rows of a deterministic lookup would memorise it, score perfectly, and",
    "prove nothing — the brief for this project rules that out by name. A table",
    "is honest, instant, and can be read and corrected by a clinician.",
    "",
    "SOURCE:",
    "cross-referenced against Doctor_Versus_Disease.csv from the Doctor",
    "Specialist Recommendation System dataset (CC BY-SA 4.0), which maps the",
    "same 41 conditions. Where this file diverges from it, the entry records",
    "`diverges` and says why. Divergences were necessary: that file assigns",
    "Typhoid to a paediatrician in an adults-only product, AIDS to",
    "'Osteopathic', Tuberculosis to 'Tuberculosis', and contains typos.",
    "",
    "Specialty names follow the project brief's own list, plus General",
    "Physician as the default when nothing more specific is warranted.",
    "",
    "NOT REVIEWED BY A CLINICIAN. Assembled for an educational project and must",
    "be reviewed before any real-world use."
  ],
